WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:02.280
What's up everybody!

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.639
I'm Emil from Pongfinity

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:06.360
And welcome to another episode of Challenge
Pongfinity!

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:09.060
This is the series where YOU challenge US

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.639
WIth your craziest ideas related to table
tennis.

00:00:11.639 --> 00:00:15.389
We will go through all of your comments, pick
the most creative ones and make a video out

00:00:15.389 --> 00:00:16.020
of them.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:19.320
If your idea gets picked, we will feature
it and give it a shout out.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:22.500
So make sure to leave your ideas in the comment-section below!

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:31.939
Anoshka Pande wants us to place a bottle on
the edge of the table

00:00:31.939 --> 00:00:35.440
And hit the bottle with a ping pong ball to
make it flip.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:54.600
Tirmisyu Trs wants me to spin a coin with
a ping pong ball.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:57.840
This time I will try to do it with a serve.

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:51.840
Madison Cerat wants me to put 6 cups on the
table

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:53.810
- I have made a pyramid out of them -

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:57.980
and I'll have to do 6 different serves to
land the balls inside the cups.

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:00.800
Madison, let's do this!

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:44.640
Joe Pitt wants me to eat a whole meal while
keeping the ball in the air with my paddle.

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:29.120
Now the burger is down, but I think the worst
part is still ahead.

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:43.190
I lost my concentration for a tenth of a second
and then that's how it goes!

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.120
O well, that was the first one.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:10.720
Okay now even the fries are down, so just
have to finish the drink.

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:19.000
So close!

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:20.800
Okay that was the second fail.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.480
Let's finish this now.

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:32.070
Alright, so that was 2 fails.

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:37.069
I'm a bit disappointed I have to say, but
actually it's not too bad.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:40.040
It's so difficult to focus on many things
at the same time.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.320
Thanks for watching guys!

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:45.250
If you enjoyed this episode, make sure to
leave it a thumbs up.

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:47.750
And if you are new to the channel subscribe
right here.

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:49.960
And watch the previous episodes here!

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:50.810
Until next time!

